<section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><span class="eyebrow">IRAH Insight</span><h1 class="gradient">Affiliate programmes without leakage</h1><p>Growth requires a partner model that rewards approved value and makes every conversion explainable.</p></div></section><section class="section"><article class="container article"><h2>Define the offer</h2><p>Set eligibility, payout, caps, quality standards and prohibited practices.</p><h2>Protect attribution</h2><p>Use server-side postbacks, deduplication, source parameters and recurring reconciliation.</p><h2>Watch quality</h2><p>Review approval rate, cohort performance, suspicious velocity and coupon misuse.</p><h2>Optimise partners</h2><p>Scale partners that contribute profitable, retained customers—not simply the most clicks.</p><h2>Next step</h2><p>Define one measurable use case, establish the baseline and test the operating model before scaling.</p><div class="actions"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="contact.php">Discuss this topic</a></div></article></section>
